Package: winoddsEIF
Type: Package
Title: Cross-Fitted Semiparametric Estimation of Marginal Win Odds
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Zhiguo", "Li", email = "zhiguo.li@duke.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements cross-fitted one-step estimators of marginal win
    probability and win odds under right censoring for scalar survival
    outcomes and prioritized semi-competing risks. Includes ridge-regularized
    event and censoring hazard fitting, influence-function standard errors,
    and an inverse-probability-of-censoring weighted comparator. Bundles
    reproducible standalone analyses of public tamoxifen trial data using
    penalized spline and exponential working hazards, and numerical
    regression comparisons with original simulation code. This is an
    initial research implementation intended for validation before release.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats
NeedsCompilation: no
Suggests: collett, splines
